        "Description": "Did someone say they like explosions? \r\rWell, these two Yakuza mobsters planned an elaborate scheme to food poidon their high school bully who&apos;s enjoying a nice relaxing day at the spa. \r\rUnluckily for them Agent47 is not a fan of the yakuza, or bullies, or pilots for some reason. \r\rAgent47 decided the only way to dispose of said bullies is to get a taste of their own medicine. \r\rGood luck.",
